r our guests</span></p><h1 id=\"page-title\" class=\"credits__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Terms of use</span></h1><p class=\"credits__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">By using this private wedding website you agree to these simple rules. They exist to keep the site useful for Sara, Tyler, and their guests.</span></p><p class=\"credits__lede\"><small><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Last updated </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">November 1, 2026</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></small></p></header><section id=\"purpose\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"purpose-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"What this site is\"><h2 id=\"purpose-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What this site is</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">kendrick.wedding is a private site for Sara and Tyler’s wedding. What you see here is wedding information for their guests and the couple, not for resale or scraping.</span></p></section><section id=\"account\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"account-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Your account\"><h2 id=\"account-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Your account</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sign-in is by invitation. Use your own email or phone, or the social sign-in option, only to access your household’s information. Do not try to sign in as someone else.</span></p></section><section id=\"content\" class=\"credits__section\" aria-labelledby=\"content-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Photos and messages\"><h2 id=\"content-title\" class=\"credits__h2\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Photos and messages</span></h2><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photos, stories, and uploads may include people who expect privacy at a wedding. Do not repost others’ images or details without their permission. Professional and guest media on the site may carry separate rights — see</span><!-- --> <a 